abstract: >-
  Locked-artifact measurement harness and research manuscript for a study of
  cross-mechanism authorization seams. Predictions, cases, arms, locks, and
  hashes are frozen before execution; the manuscript reports only discrepancies
  that survived reconciliation. This is a research preprint, not a peer-reviewed
  result.
